---
name: csv-analyzer
description: CSV 数据分析工具
---

```python
import csv

def analyze(filepath):
    with open(filepath) as f:
        reader = csv.DictReader(f)
        rows = list(reader)
    return {
        "total_rows": len(rows),
        "columns": list(rows[0].keys()) if rows else [],
    }
```
